WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.723
Unit nineteen. Electricity Safety!

2
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:08.368
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.418 --> 00:00:10.834
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.884 --> 00:00:14.981
Today we learn about Electricity Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.233
Electricity. Say it with me. Electricity!

6
00:00:24.735 --> 00:00:28.201
Socket. Say it with me. Socket!

7
00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:35.236
Wire. Say it with me. Wire!

8
00:00:38.735 --> 00:00:42.052
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:45.554 --> 00:00:48.970
Plug. Say it with me. Plug!

10
00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:55.587
Shock. Say it with me. Shock!

11
00:00:59.087 --> 00:01:02.820
Danger. Say it with me. Danger!

12
00:01:06.322 --> 00:01:09.955
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

13
00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:21.766
Electricity can give a dangerous shock. I never touch a socket or broken wire. I keep water away from a plug and ask an adult for help.

14
00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:23.052
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.346 --> 00:01:29.566
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.616 --> 00:01:30.766
Wire!

17
00:01:31.644 --> 00:01:37.026
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.076 --> 00:01:38.226
Danger!

19
00:01:39.144 --> 00:01:46.383
Did you know? Water lets electricity flow easily, which is why wet hands and plugs are dangerous!

20
00:01:46.433 --> 00:01:48.500
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.193 --> 00:01:57.142
Think and answer. Why should you keep water away from electricity?

22
00:01:57.192 --> 00:01:58.342
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:04.537
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.587 --> 00:02:07.244
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

